InProgress --> Review : request review if adopted
Review --> Done : actual task completion criteria satisfied
Review --> InProgress : rework
Todo --> Cancelled : explicit permitted cancellation
InProgress --> Cancelled : explicit permitted cancellation
note right of Done
 Illustrative status vocabulary only; Q-D18 remains proposed.
 Task Done does not mean backlog item accepted.
 Item acceptance and Sprint Goal outcome are separate decisions.
end note
note bottom of Review
 This is a selected transition example, not a complete allowed-transition matrix.
